WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:04.690
<i>The battle between Tron and I in the Sphere Field is getting intense.</i>

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>Not even the power Astral and I formed, ZEXAL, could bring him down.</i>

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.210
<i>But I can't afford to lose this Duel!</i>

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.990
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.490
Yuma...

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.540
I have to admit I'm impressed,

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.540
though this is as far as you'll go!

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.920
I never thought you'd get past that unscathed...

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.480
But, that was your ultimate move, wasn't?

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.990
With your special move out of the picture now, that means...

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.940
...you no longer have any chance of winning!

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.130
I will never give up!

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:52.390
Not before I deliver the feelings that everyone entrusted me with!

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.650
And to make things clear, I <i>will not</i> give up!!

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.710
I don't need such things!

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:01.110
It's my turn! Draw!!

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.250
It's the end of the road for you two!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.600
Coat of Arm's effect activates!

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.710
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.860
I can use the effect taken from Hope Ray!

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:16.860
For this turn, Coat of Arm's Attack Power is raised 500 points,

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:20.240
while Hope Ray's Attack Power drops by 1000 points.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:25.160
I'll bury you alive with Hope Ray's effect!

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:29.620
Coat of Arms attacks Hope Ray!!

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.910
God Rage!!

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:39.730
Trap, activate! Half Unbreak!

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:43.160
The Monster targeted in battle won't be destroyed during this turn,

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.840
and the damage during this battle is halved!

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.250
Yuma!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.970
Now he only has 50 Life left!

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.930
Persistent pest.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:12.910
I'm not done. I still have Life left!

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:17.660
When I watch that unyielding will of yours, I'm reminded of Kazuma.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.110
Just like Kazuma, irritating!

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.410
I won't allow you to insult my father!

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.270
Calm down, Yuma.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:29.420
Thanks to the previous attack, I figured out a winning formula.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.340
Really?

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.550
Astral!

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:36.860
Don't tell me you realized that Coat of Arms was running out of Overlay Units,

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:40.500
and that you would win with that?

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:46.610
I activate Heraldic Beast - Twinhead Eagle’s effect from my Graveyard!

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:51.260
By Banishing this card from my Graveyard,

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:55.630
Coat of Arms restores two Overlay Units.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.070
His Overlay Units...

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.550
It's about time you give it up.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:08.180
I set a card face-down and end my turn.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.630
3800 versus 50...

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.630
The match is basically over now.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.970
To summarize, Yuma-<i>kun</i> might have met his match.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:26.340
Yuma...

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:37.960
<i>Yuma.</i>

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.820
<i>This is bad, very bad.</i>

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:49.960
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:55.300
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:12.150
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:17.950
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:22.540
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:28.580
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:33.670
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:39.220
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:45.020
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:50.060
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:55.530
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:01.200
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:07.370
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:13.460
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.210
What's wrong, Yuma?

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.460
Are you alright?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.130
Yuma!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.550
My tummy...

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.680
Man, I'm starvin'.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.680
Why are you saying this now?

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:33.020
"Number 67: Believe in Victory!
 The Final Shining Draw!"

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.470
I really am hungry!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.520
Oh right!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:38.730
Isn't that...

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.280
<i>Eat it and be sure to win!</i>

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.280
Here it is!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.240
It's the Duel Lunch Kotori gave me!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:48.990
NOM!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.330
Wh-What's he doing?!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.580
Does this mean Yuma-<i>kun</i> gave up the Duel?

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.880
No way.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:00.920
You're wrong.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.960
Yuma ain't done yet!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.010
That's right!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.510
Go, Yuma!!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.010
Now this is something.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.010
Eating while Dueling.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:13.180
NOM!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.440
What's this feeling?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.690
Oh yeah! This is your first time eating it.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.610
So this is "eating"?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.160
Yep. You can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:35.700
Unbelievable! I can feel my fighting spirit burning inside me.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.710
Haha, ain't that right?

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:42.080
So this is how it is to feel alive.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.630
Even if it goes away, this sensation is unbelievable!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.760
It's interesting!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.300
It has become very interesting staying with you, Yuma!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.470
Let's win this, Astral!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:58.100
Yeah, but I want some more Duel Lunches!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.270
I want two bowls, no, three!

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.570
I want to feel alive again!!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.900
Now we're talkin', Astral!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:12.910
Our winning formula is set, Yuma.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.990
Just believe in me!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.950
Yeah!

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.210
It's my turn!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.670
Light and strength, gather on me!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:28.760
Illuminate the path towards hope once again!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.760
Final Shining Draw!!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.680
I have been waiting for this!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.560
I equip this card to Hope Ray!

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.400
Come forth, ZEXAL Weapon!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.480
Tornado Bringer!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.960
What? A twin-sword ZEXAL weapon?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.460
Due to equiping Tornado Bringer, Hope Ray's Attack Power...

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.090
...is raised by 1300 points!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.600
5000 Attack Points?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:25.100
To add, the Monster equipped with Tornado Bringer, now an Equip Card, cannot be destroyed!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.610
Plus, when Lightning Blade is used as an equip card,

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.530
Magic and Trap cards on my field cannot be destroyed when targeted!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.780
In other words, you can't destroy either of them!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.410
What was that?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.830
You're saying that your equip combo with the ZEXAL Weapons...

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:47.290
...prevents Coat of Arms' card-destroying effect from activating?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.630
That's right.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.550
Hope Ray's twin-sword combo is invincible!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.430
Go, Hope Ray!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.970
Attack Coat of Arms!!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.970
Hope King Double Chaos Slash!!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.030
It's finished!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.070
You sure?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.740
Trap, activate! Blast Medallion!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:28.630
This card returns your ZEXAL Weapons to your hand during a Battle.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.000
This also ends the Battle Phase.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.550
N-no way!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.850
My ZEXAL Weapons...

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:46.190
And to add, Blast Medallion's effect, for every card sent back to your hand,

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:50.900
inflicts 500 points of damage at the end of the turn!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.900
What was that?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.740
Your Battle Phase is over.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.160
All that's left is ending your turn.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:04.120
Which means you lose, Yuma and Astral!!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.880
Even so, we won't give up!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.050
I'm not giving up!!

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.710
Nice one, Yuma.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:17.340
But how are you gonna get out of this?

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.680
About that...

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.720
Same as always, huh?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.140
But you got the "not giving up" part down.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:31.190
It's getting ugly, Astral.
 Your Battle Phase is over.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.690
Like I said,

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.280
our winning formula is set!

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.280
What?

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.410
Let's go, Yuma!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.200
Got it, Astral!

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.740
I activate the Magic Card, ZEXAL Catapult!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:51.040
This card Special Summons a ZEXAL Weapon from my hand!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.710
Come forth, Lightning Blade!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.350
It's no use.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:07.310
You forgot this! Coat of Arms' effect activates!

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:13.310
It negates and absorbs all Monster effects on the field!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.570
And now I activate Amarelease's effect from the Graveyard!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.530
The Graveyard?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.070
By removing Amarelease from the Graveyard,

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:28.040
I can decrease the number of Monsters needed to Advance Summon by one!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.920
Come forth, Tornado Bringer!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.590
Didn't I tell you it's useless?

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.920
Coat of Arms' effect activates!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:44.050
Absorb Tornado Bringer's effect!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.350
Now both your ZEXAL Weapon's effect have been absorbed!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:54.900
No way. He's out of options.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.690
Now it's all over...

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.190
Yuma...

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.780
What a useless struggle, Yuma and Astral.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.700
Really now?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.870
Tornado Bringer and Lightning Blade's Levels are five!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.460
Everything is set!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.670
Don't tell me those ZEXAL Weapons...

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.840
It's exactly what you're thinking, Tron!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:28.060
I Overlay my Level five Lighting Blade and Tornado Bringer!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.680
I build the Overlay Network with my two ZEXAL Weapons.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.560
Xyz Summon!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.770
Come forth, ZEXAL Weapon!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.780
Lion Arms!!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.580
A ZEXAL Weapon that's an Xyz Monster?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.870
This card can be used as an Equip card with Hope Ray, and with it equipped...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.880
raises its Attack points by 300!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:02.010
And this effect cannot be negated!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.680
The raging impact from the warrior's golden armor will shake the ground!

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.100
Blitz of Lightning!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.100
Grant the warrior the strength of a God slayer!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.060
The Beast-Armor fusion! Lion King Hope Ray!!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.440
And with 5500 Attack points...

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.230
Have you forgotten?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.700
Your Battle Phase turn is over!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.240
No! Lion Arms' effect activates!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:33.580
Lion Arms can attack again when the Battle Phase is over!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.540
No way! Two Battle Phases in one turn?!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.170
This is the ultimate ZEXAL Weapon!!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:45.590
But your ZEXAL Weapon's effects are now mine, so your invincibility is gone!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.590
Coat of Arm's effect activates!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:54.890
Bare witness to Coat of Arms' <i>true form</i>!!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:06.950
It destroys one card on my opponent's field!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.870
Smash Hope Ray to pieces!!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.080
God Shatter!!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.460
Lion Arm's effect activates!!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:20.960
Once per turn, this card negates a Monster's effect...

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.300
and halves its Attack points!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.010
No way...

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.340
Now go, Lion King Hope Ray!!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:34.390
Hope Sword - Triple Chaos Slash!!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:13.350
He won!! Yuma won!!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.680
He won!!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.010
He did it!!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.980
He won!! ZEXALornot won!!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:22.020
He got him, yeah ZEXALornot!!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.770
Yuma Tsukumo...

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:27.570
He won...

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:37.540
I give to you the first ever World Duel Carnival winner, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.640
So Byron lost...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:57.890
But none of that matters in the end.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:02.730
I'll just recover the Numbers here and now.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.320
W-what the...

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.280
Is this...

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.780
What's going on here?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:24.630
What the...

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.340
The Numbers are...!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.840
I won't let you, Faker!!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.680
Tron!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.540
Yuma! Yuma!!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:04.750
Yuma!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.460
It's no use, Byron!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:16.930
Your power is useless without the Numbers.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.240
Disappear, Byron!!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:36.910
Tron!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.430
Yuma...

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.430
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.520
Kazuma...

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:07.730
Shit, what the hell is going on?!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.860
Yuma, Astral.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:14.940
The Sphere Field is a field meant to recover all the Numbers.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:15.900
What?

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.610
What do you mean?

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:22.370
The Duel Carnival brought all the Numbers together.

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.870
No way would Dr. Faker waste this opportunity.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:32.290
So from the start, this field was a trap?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:37.800
Correct. He let us battle here so we would expand the Number's power.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.800
Shit...

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.970
Let go!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.980
We're foreign objects in this field.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.310
At this rate, you two will also...

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.770
No way...!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:54.270
I... I won't give up!!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:55.860
But why?

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.820
Why are you trying to save me?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:02.490
It's obvious, isn't it?! Everyone I Duel are my friends!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.450
Yuma...

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.290
I don't understand all this complicated stuff.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.170
But we create bonds with friends through Dueling!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:14.250
And since you Dueled me, you are my friend!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.680
I finally understand.

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.680
Now I see why you don't give up.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.470
Your Dueling goes beyond my desire for revenge.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.850
Yuma, I can't live the same way as you and Kazuma.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.440
Tron!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:38.240
But I can't allow Faker to do what he wants.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.030
I'll release all the souls I've captured!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.420
Farewell, Yuma, Astral.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:07.060
Tron!!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.650
<i>Father!</i>

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.030
<i>Dad!</i>

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.190
<i>Father!</i>

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.290
<i>Forgive me, everyone.</i>

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:32.410
<i>This time, I will never forget those times...</i>

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.260
Tron!!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:56.770
We've...

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.020
Brother!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.950
Astral!

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.110
Yuma!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.630
Yuma...

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:34.810
I've been longing for this moment! Yuma Tsukumo! Astral!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.950
Dr. Faker.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:54.960
Now then, it's time for the finishing touches.

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:59.750
The finishing touches for the destruction of the Astral World!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:15.520
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:21.150
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:31.830
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.370
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.080
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:42.710
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:47.920
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:53.260
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.890
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:05.400
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:10.860
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:21.750
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:26.960
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:45.230
Due to Faker's power, we're stuck in the Sphere Field.

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:48.530
Meanwhile, Shark and Kaito have arrived at the collapsing stadium.

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:53.280
The Duelists guided by the light of destiny will now gather here!

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:54.820
This is the place from before!

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:56.870
He's going to destroy the Astral World?

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.000
We have to protect the future!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.250
You guys are our only remaining hope.

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.750
Next time, on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:07.380
"The Overture Towards Destruction!
 The Threat of Sphere Field Cannon!"

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:09.380
Lend me your power!!

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.930
The ZEXAL Weapon today sure was awesome!

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:15.550
But now that we've got a ZEXAL Weapon,

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.720
I wonder if a ZEXAL Bell Clapper will ever show up?

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:20.020
I sure hope a ZEXAL Side Clapper appears.

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:22.310
You can do something like that? I'm excited!

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:23.730
You're hopeless...
